WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.085
A referral code on Binance only works if you enter it at the right moment.

00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:09.860
Here are the four steps, and then the three mistakes that make a code count for nothing.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:16.810
First, on binance.com, choose register and enter your email or phone number.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.295
Confirm it is you with the 6-digit code Binance sends.

00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:27.477
Choose a password with at least eight characters, a number and an uppercase letter.

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:30.647
Now the final screen.

00:00:30.727 --> 00:00:39.194
Find the optional field called Referral ID and type REFCO888, spelled R-E-F-C-O-8-8-8.

00:00:39.274 --> 00:00:44.951
If you used the sign-up link on referral-code.org, the field is already filled in for you.

00:00:46.101 --> 00:00:48.121
So why use a code at all?

00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:56.141
First, REFCO888 is a Referral Pro code, so you get part of your own trading fees back, paid in USDC.

00:00:56.221 --> 00:00:59.291
Binance shows your exact rate on the sign-up page.

00:00:59.371 --> 00:01:03.643
Second, one code covers spot, margin and futures.

00:01:03.723 --> 00:01:06.048
Third, it costs you nothing.

00:01:06.128 --> 00:01:10.160
Your fee rate stays the same, and the rebate comes back on top.

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:13.330
Mistake one.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.917
Depositing before the code is linked.

00:01:15.997 --> 00:01:20.857
After your first deposit or trade, a code can no longer be added.

00:01:20.937 --> 00:01:22.957
Mistake two.

00:01:23.037 --> 00:01:26.794
Typing a different code into the Futures Referral ID field.

00:01:26.874 --> 00:01:30.531
It only accepts the code from whoever referred your main account.

00:01:30.611 --> 00:01:32.631
Mistake three.

00:01:32.711 --> 00:01:34.731
Not checking your region.

00:01:34.811 --> 00:01:41.754
Since July 2026, users registered in EEA countries cannot take part in the referral programme.

00:01:42.904 --> 00:01:45.916
The code is REFCO888.

00:01:45.996 --> 00:01:49.634
The full rules and answers are on referral-code.org.

